  "uncertainty": "Earlier source material indicates ESPN was 80% owned by ABC, Inc. (an indirect subsidiary of Disney) and 20% by Hearst; however, following the transaction closed in early 2026 granting the NFL a 10% equity stake in exchange for NFL Media assets, ownership is updated across newer sources to 72% Disney, 18% Hearst, and 10% NFL."
